Depends: libc6 (>= 2.35), libgcc-s1, libstdc++6, libx11-6, libxext6, libxrender1, libxkbcommon0, libwayland-client0, libegl1, libgl1, libglu1-mesa, libopengl0, libgomp1, libxcb1, zlib1g
Description: FieldCraft with a private NGSolve runtime
 Model and mesh in FieldCraft, run a user-supplied Python calculation, and
 inspect its mesh-verified scalar and vector fields and integrals.
